{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Log work or money"},"description":"Write work done, money in or out, or both, into the farm records,\nin the person's words. `unit` names the crop or batch it was for (its\nname or id); leave it out for the whole farm. `day` defaults to today.\n\nWork: `what`, and optionally `operation` (PLANTING, WEEDING,\nFERTILISING, SPRAYING, IRRIGATION, SCOUTING, HARVEST, POST_HARVEST,\nLAND_PREP, FEEDING or OTHER).\nMoney: `amount` with `money` (\"income\" or \"expense\"); `category` in\ntheir words or a code (feed, day-old chicks, vaccine, labour, transport,\nbird sale, crop sale\u2026), worked out when left out; `currency` defaults to\nthe farm's; `quantity` is how many were bought or sold (birds sold this\nway leave the flock count).\n\nPass the same `client_id` (a UUID) to retry safely.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"amount":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Amount"},"category":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Category"},"client_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Client Id"},"currency":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Currency"},"day":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Day"},"farm_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Farm Id"},"money":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["income","expense"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Money"},"operation":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Operation"},"quantity":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Quantity"},"unit":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Unit"},"what":{"default":"","title":"What","type":"string"}},"title":"log_workArguments","type":"object"},"name":"log_work","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"MoneyRecorded":{"properties":{"amount":{"title":"Amount","type":"number"},"category":{"title":"Category","type":"string"},"currency":{"title":"Currency","type":"string"},"direction":{"title":"Direction","type":"string"},"for_what":{"default":"","title":"For What","type":"string"},"ledger_entry_id":{"title":"Ledger Entry Id","type":"string"}},"required":["ledger_entry_id","direction","amount","currency","category"],"title":"MoneyRecorded","type":"object"}},"properties":{"day":{"title":"Day","type":"string"},"diary_entry_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Diary Entry Id"},"farm_id":{"title":"Farm Id","type":"string"},"finish_in_divisi":{"default":"","title":"Finish In Divisi","type":"string"},"finish_link":{"default":"","title":"Finish Link","type":"string"},"link":{"title":"Link","type":"string"},"money":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/MoneyRecorded"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"summary":{"title":"Summary","type":"string"}},"required":["summary","farm_id","day","link"],"title":"Logged","type":"object"},"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}],"title":"Log work or money"}
